window.LEARN_CONTENT=window.LEARN_CONTENT||{};window.LEARN_CONTENT["a-cc150e5c431106ac"]={"zh":"<h1 id=\"chatgpt\">在电脑上使用 ChatGPT</h1> <p>让 ChatGPT 在 macOS 或 Windows 电脑上点击、输入并操作应用。</p> <p>在 ChatGPT 桌面应用中使用 Computer Use，在 macOS 或 Windows 应用和本地文件之间完成范围明确的任务，并在最后审阅结果。已登录浏览器任务请单独通过 Chrome 启动。</p> <h2 id=\"_1\">适合哪些情况</h2> <ul> <li>需要在多个桌面应用、窗口或本地文件之间切换的任务。</li> <li>需要 macOS 后台操作体验，或需要 Windows 专用前台会话的工作。</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"_2\">起步提示词</h2> <p>委派一项电脑操作任务</p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">@Computer 帮我完成 [task]。\n\n请按需使用我的桌面应用或文件。发送内容、购买或更改重要信息之前，先询问我。\n</code></pre> <h2 id=\"_3\">关联文档</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-7be3f970bd43699c\">Computer Use</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-dea5d8982f047a3a\">插件</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-2645e597941a2d38\">自定义 ChatGPT</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>完整文档索引请参阅 <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt（需联网）</a>。在文档页面 URL 末尾添加 <code>.md</code>，即可获取该页面的 Markdown 版本。</p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"_4\">简介</h2> <p>当任务需要在多个桌面应用、窗口或本地文件之间切换时，可以使用 <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/docs/computer-use\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Computer Use（需联网）</a>。ChatGPT 可以在你允许的应用中点击、输入和导航，然后把结果交还给你审阅。若要操作网站或已登录的浏览器会话，请使用 <code>@Chrome</code> 单独启动一项浏览器任务。</p> <p><strong>Computer Use 需要 ChatGPT 桌面应用。</strong> 在支持的地区，ChatGPT Work 和 Codex 中的 Computer Use 可用于 macOS 和 Windows。网页端或移动端的 Cloud Work 任务无法直接访问本地应用、文件或已登录的桌面浏览器会话。连接 Mac 或 Windows 主机后，也可以通过 <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/remote-connections\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Remote on mobile（本地尚未收录）</a> 从移动设备启动或控制桌面任务。</p> <p>典型场景包括：把笔记整理进记录系统、在起草回复前核对几个应用中的上下文，或在没有专用插件的工具之间复制已批准的信息。</p> <p>下面是一个安全的桌面任务交接示例：Messages 和 Notes 中包含了一次小木屋周末行程的计划。</p> <p><strong>桌面任务：</strong> 从 Messages 中收集小木屋周末出游想法，对照 Notes 中的候选清单，创建一条本地笔记并起草回复。</p> <p><strong>结果：</strong> Pine Lodge 无台阶，车程在两小时以内，总价为 $690。Lake House 可能合适，但还需确认车程和无障碍情况。Cedar Ridge 因有楼梯而排除。同行人数未知，因此每人费用仍需视情况确定。</p> <p>本地笔记和回复草稿已准备好供审阅。没有预订或发送任何内容。</p> <h2 id=\"_5\">使用方法</h2> <ol> <li>打开 ChatGPT 桌面应用，并安装 <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/docs/computer-use\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Computer Use 插件（需联网）</a>。</li> <li>桌面应用任务以 <code>@Computer</code> 开始；浏览器任务以 <code>@Chrome</code> 开始。</li> <li>说明要完成的任务、涉及的应用或文件，以及你希望得到的结果。</li> <li>查看访问权限提示；在执行会发送、提交内容或更改重要数据的操作前暂停并确认。</li> <li>在 Windows 上运行 Computer Use 时，让目标应用保持可见。</li> </ol> <p>如果某个应用有插件，ChatGPT 可能会使用该插件执行结构化操作。如果任务依赖应用界面，或者没有可用插件，则适合使用 Computer Use。</p> <h2 id=\"_6\">可以尝试的任务</h2> <p>从一个工具开始：桌面应用和本地文件使用 <code>@Computer</code>；浏览器使用 <code>@Chrome</code>。ChatGPT 可根据需要选择其它工具。</p> <p><strong>把消息整理成计划</strong></p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">@Computer Check my Messages for our weekend trip, compare the cabin shortlist in Notes, and draft a reply. Don't send it.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">@Computer 查看 Messages 中关于我们周末旅行的消息，对比 Notes 中的木屋候选清单，并起草回复。不要发送。</div></div> <p><strong>寻找住宿地点</strong></p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">@Chrome Search Airbnb for cabins within two hours of San Francisco. Compare price, availability, cancellation policy, and step-free access. Don't book anything.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">@Chrome 在 Airbnb 上搜索距离旧金山两小时车程以内的木屋。比较价格、可订情况、取消政策，以及是否提供无台阶通道。不要预订任何房源。</div></div> <p><strong>了解项目进展</strong></p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">@Computer Check my project tracker and recent messages. Tell me what's changed, what's blocked, and which follow-ups I need to send. Don't message anyone.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">@Computer 查看我的项目跟踪工具和最近的消息。告诉我有哪些变化、哪些事项受阻，以及我需要发送哪些后续消息。不要联系任何人。</div></div> <p><strong>根据会议笔记更新跟踪表</strong></p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">@Computer Open my meeting notes, find the decisions and action items, and prepare the matching updates in the project tracker. Ask me before submitting anything.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">@Computer 打开我的会议记录，找出决定和行动事项，并在项目跟踪工具中准备相应更新。提交任何内容前，先征求我的同意。</div></div> <p><strong>操作已登录的浏览器</strong></p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">@Chrome Open the customer account in my signed-in browser, check the latest activity and support tickets, and draft a quick update. Don't send it.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">@Chrome 在我已登录的浏览器中打开客户账户，检查最新活动和支持工单，并起草一份简短更新。不要发送。</div></div> <p><strong>测试网站</strong></p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">@Chrome Open http://localhost:3000, check the pricing page on mobile, and tell me what needs fixing. Don't publish or submit anything.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">@Chrome 打开 http://localhost:3000 ，检查定价页的移动端表现，并告诉我需要修复哪些问题。不要发布或提交任何内容。</div></div> <p><strong>整理本地文件</strong></p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">@Computer Review my Downloads folder and show me how you'd organize the project files. Ask before moving or deleting anything.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">@Computer 查看我的 Downloads 文件夹，并展示你会如何整理其中的项目文件。移动或删除任何内容前，先征求我的同意。</div></div> <h2 id=\"_7\">展示当前界面</h2> <p>在 macOS 上，可以使用 <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/appshots\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">appshot（本地尚未收录）</a> 分享当前置前应用的 AppShot。AppShot 用于提供界面背景；如果你允许，Computer Use 可以随后打开并操作该应用。</p> <p><strong>提示词：</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">@Computer Look at this AppShot, find the same screen in the app, and tell me what I need to do. Ask before changing anything.\n</code></pre><div class=\"prompt-translation\"><div class=\"prompt-reference-heading\"><strong>提示词中文参考</strong><button class=\"copy-code copy-prompt-translation\" type=\"button\" aria-label=\"复制中文参考\">复制中文</button></div><div class=\"prompt-reference-text\">@Computer 查看这张 AppShot，在应用中找到相同界面，并告诉我需要做什么。更改任何内容前，先征求我的同意。</div></div> <h2 id=\"_8\">实用技巧</h2> <h3 id=\"_9\">了解任务在不同电脑上的运行方式</h3> <p>在 macOS 上，当你继续使用其它应用时，Computer Use 也可以在后台运行。画中画预览会显示正在操作的应用；打开预览即可跟随查看，也可以将其移出视线。如果你使用 Pet，还可以把预览移动到 Pet 上。</p> <p>在 Windows 上，Computer Use 会在活动桌面上运行并占用前台。运行期间，鼠标指针和键盘都会移动。请保持设备解锁并连接；或者在 Windows 虚拟机中运行桌面应用，以免影响主设备的使用。</p> <h3 id=\"_10\">准备已登录应用并在锁定状态下使用</h3> <p>开始桌面任务前，请先登录任务需要的应用和服务。在 macOS 上，如果任务需要在 Mac 锁定后继续，可以启用<a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/docs/computer-use#locked-use\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">锁定状态下继续操作（需联网）</a>。Windows 版 Computer Use 不支持锁定状态下继续操作。</p> <h3 id=\"_11\">选择合适的浏览器</h3> <p>浏览器任务常常属于 Computer Use 的使用场景。根据需要选择浏览器：</p> <ul> <li><strong><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/chrome-extension\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Chrome 扩展（本地尚未收录）</a>：</strong> 网页任务使用 <code>@Chrome</code>，包括搜索网站，以及使用现有 Chrome 配置文件、标签页或扩展。</li> <li><strong><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/browser?surface=app\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">内置浏览器（本地尚未收录）</a>：</strong> 需要为本地网站或公开、未登录的网站单独启动浏览器会话时使用。它拥有独立的浏览器状态，并可等待你登录。</li> <li><strong>ChatGPT Work 网页端的云浏览器：</strong> 适用于受支持的公开、未登录网站。它无法访问本地文件、已打开的标签页或扩展，也无法使用已保存的密码登录或完成付款。</li> </ul> <p>当具体使用哪种浏览器很重要时，请在请求中指明浏览器；如果想重复使用某项偏好，可以在<a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/docs/customization/overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">自定义设置（需联网）</a>中配置。</p> <h3 id=\"_12\">避免在同一应用中并行运行任务</h3> <p>不要同时对同一个应用运行两项 Computer Use 任务。多个任务相互竞争会改变当前窗口或状态，导致结果不可靠。</p>","en":"<h1 id=\"use-your-computer-with-chatgpt\">Use your computer with ChatGPT</h1> <p>Let ChatGPT click, type, and navigate apps on your macOS or Windows computer.</p> <p>In the ChatGPT desktop app, use Computer Use to complete a scoped task across macOS or Windows apps and local files, with permission prompts and a final result you can review. Start signed-in browser tasks separately with Chrome.</p> <h2 id=\"best-for\">Best for</h2> <ul> <li>Tasks that move across desktop apps, windows, or local files.</li> <li>Work that needs the macOS background experience or a dedicated Windows foreground session.</li> </ul> <h2 id=\"starter-prompt\">Starter prompt</h2> <p>Hand off one computer task</p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">@Computer Help me [task].\n\nUse my desktop apps or files as needed. Ask before sending, buying, or changing anything important.\n</code></pre> <h2 id=\"related-links\">Related links</h2> <ul> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-7be3f970bd43699c\">Computer Use</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-dea5d8982f047a3a\">Plugins</a></li> <li><a href=\"#/article/a-2645e597941a2d38\">Customize ChatGPT</a></li> </ul> <blockquote> <p>For the complete documentation index, see <a href=\"https://learn.chatgpt.com/llms.txt\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">llms.txt (online)</a>. Markdown versions of documentation pages are available by appending <code>.md</code> to the page URL.</p> </blockquote> <h2 id=\"introduction\">Introduction</h2> <p>Use <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/docs/computer-use\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Computer Use (online)</a> when a task moves across desktop apps, windows, or local files. ChatGPT can click, type, and navigate the apps you allow, then return the result for review. For a website or signed-in browser session, start a separate browser task with <code>@Chrome</code>.</p> <p><strong>Computer Use requires the ChatGPT desktop app.</strong> In supported regions, Computer Use is available on macOS and Windows in ChatGPT Work and Codex. Cloud Work tasks on web or mobile cannot directly access your local apps, files, or signed-in desktop browser sessions. You can start or steer a desktop task from <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/remote-connections\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Remote on mobile (not in this local snapshot)</a> when you connect a Mac or Windows host.</p> <p>Good examples include moving notes into a system of record, checking context across a few apps before drafting a reply, or copying approved details between tools that don't have a dedicated plugin.</p> <p>Here is what a safe desktop handoff can look like when Messages and Notes contain your cabin-weekend plans:</p> <p><strong>Desktop task:</strong> Gather cabin-weekend ideas from Messages and a shortlist in Notes, create a local note, and draft a reply.</p> <p><strong>Result:</strong> Pine Lodge is step-free, within two hours, and costs $690 total. Lake House may work, but travel time and accessibility still need confirmation. Cedar Ridge is excluded because it has stairs. The group size is unknown, so per-person pricing stays conditional.</p> <p>The local note and reply draft are ready for review. Nothing was booked or sent.</p> <h2 id=\"how-to-use\">How to use</h2> <ol> <li>Open the ChatGPT desktop app and install the <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/docs/computer-use\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Computer Use plugin (online)</a>.</li> <li>Start your request with <code>@Computer</code> for desktop apps or <code>@Chrome</code> for browser tasks.</li> <li>Describe the task, the apps or files involved, and the result you want.</li> <li>Review access prompts and pause before actions that send, submit, or change important data.</li> <li>On Windows, keep the target app visible while Computer Use runs.</li> </ol> <p>If a plugin exists for an app, ChatGPT may use the plugin for the structured action. Computer Use is useful when the task depends on the app interface or a plugin isn't available.</p> <h2 id=\"things-to-try\">Things to try</h2> <p>Start with one tool: use <code>@Computer</code> for desktop apps and local files, or <code>@Chrome</code> for your browser. ChatGPT can choose other tools as needed.</p> <p><strong>Turn messages into a plan</strong></p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">@Computer Check my Messages for our weekend trip, compare the cabin shortlist in Notes, and draft a reply. Don't send it.\n</code></pre> <p><strong>Find places to stay</strong></p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">@Chrome Search Airbnb for cabins within two hours of San Francisco. Compare price, availability, cancellation policy, and step-free access. Don't book anything.\n</code></pre> <p><strong>Catch up on a project</strong></p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">@Computer Check my project tracker and recent messages. Tell me what's changed, what's blocked, and which follow-ups I need to send. Don't message anyone.\n</code></pre> <p><strong>Update a tracker from meeting notes</strong></p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">@Computer Open my meeting notes, find the decisions and action items, and prepare the matching updates in the project tracker. Ask me before submitting anything.\n</code></pre> <p><strong>Work in your signed-in browser</strong></p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">@Chrome Open the customer account in my signed-in browser, check the latest activity and support tickets, and draft a quick update. Don't send it.\n</code></pre> <p><strong>Test a website</strong></p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">@Chrome Open http://localhost:3000, check the pricing page on mobile, and tell me what needs fixing. Don't publish or submit anything.\n</code></pre> <p><strong>Clean up local files</strong></p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">@Computer Review my Downloads folder and show me how you'd organize the project files. Ask before moving or deleting anything.\n</code></pre> <p><strong>Show it what you're looking at</strong></p> <p>On macOS, use an <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/appshots\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">appshot (not in this local snapshot)</a> to share the app window in front of you. Appshots provide visual context; Computer Use can then open, inspect, and interact with the app if you allow it.</p> <p><strong>Prompt:</strong></p> <pre><code class=\"language-text\">@Computer Look at this AppShot, find the same screen in the app, and tell me what I need to do. Ask before changing anything.\n</code></pre> <h2 id=\"practical-tips\">Practical tips</h2> <h3 id=\"understand-how-the-task-runs-on-each-computer\">Understand how the task runs on each computer</h3> <p>On macOS, Computer Use can work in the background while you use other apps. A picture-in-picture preview shows the active app; open the preview to follow along or move it out of the way. If you use a Pet, you can move the preview there.</p> <p>On Windows, Computer Use runs on the active desktop and takes over the foreground. Expect the pointer and keyboard to move while the task runs. Keep the device unlocked and connected, or run the desktop app in a Windows virtual machine if you need to keep using your main desktop.</p> <h3 id=\"choose-the-right-browser\">Choose the right browser</h3> <p>Browser tasks are often part of Computer Use. Choose the browser that has the context you need:</p> <ul> <li><strong><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/chrome-extension\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Chrome extension (not in this local snapshot)</a>:</strong> Use <code>@Chrome</code> for browser tasks, including listing searches, websites, and your existing signed-in Chrome profile, tabs, or extensions.</li> <li><strong><a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/codex/browser?surface=app\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">Built-in browser (not in this local snapshot)</a>:</strong> Use it when you want a separate browser session for localhost or public sites. It has its own browser state and can wait while you sign in.</li> <li><strong>Cloud browser in ChatGPT Work on web or mobile:</strong> Use it for supported public, signed-out sites. It cannot access local files, open tabs, extensions, or saved passwords, sign in to sites, or complete payments.</li> </ul> <p>Name the browser in the prompt when it matters, and use <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/docs/customization/overview\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">customization (online)</a> for a recurring desktop preference.</p> <h3 id=\"avoid-parallel-runs-in-the-same-app\">Avoid parallel runs in the same app</h3> <p>Do not run two Computer Use tasks against the same app at the same time. Competing actions can change the current window or state and make the result unreliable.</p> <h3 id=\"prepare-signed-in-apps-and-locked-use\">Prepare signed-in apps and locked use</h3> <p>Before starting a desktop task, sign in to the apps and services it needs. On macOS, you can enable <a href=\"https://developers.openai.com/docs/computer-use#locked-use\" target=\"_blank\" rel=\"noopener noreferrer\">locked use (online)</a> if the task must continue after the Mac locks. Locked use is not available for Windows Computer Use.</p>"};
